                         391 --214: /**
                         392 --215: [Overview]\n
                         393 --216:  sends one byte via the VUART
                         394 --218:  [Description]\n
                         395 --219:  Monitor the UART status and wait for the transmittable status (transmission data
                         396 --220:  register is empty).
                         397 --221:  Send 1-byte data when it is ready to be sent.
